   DisplayForm],
  Derivative[0, 0, 0, 1, 0][
  SpinWeightedSpheroidalHarmonics`SpinWeightedSphericalHarmonicY][
  1 + $CellContext`s, $CellContext`l, $CellContext`m, $CellContext`\[Theta], \
